---
// The three steps of ordering. A real sequence, so the steps are numbered.
---

<ol class="order-steps">
  <li class="order-step">
    <h3 class="order-step-title">Izberite izdelke</h3>
    <p>Na strani Naročilo izberete, kaj in koliko želite.</p>
  </li>
  <li class="order-step">
    <h3 class="order-step-title">Osebna dostava</h3>
    <p>Naročilo prinesemo osebno od ponedeljka do srede, dan vam sporočimo.</p>
  </li>
  <li class="order-step">
    <h3 class="order-step-title">Plačilo ob prevzemu</h3>
    <p>Plačate z gotovino ob prevzemu.</p>
  </li>
</ol>

<style>
  .order-steps {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: order-step;
  }

  .order-step {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    counter-increment: order-step;
  }

  .order-step::before {
    content: counter(order-step);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: var(--step-circle);
    height: var(--step-circle);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    border: var(--border-width) solid var(--color-green);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .order-step-title {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .order-step p {
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .order-steps {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
